    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47872" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tĕrīna</span></b> , ae,
			f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in the Bruttian territory</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5,
				10, § 72</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 8,
			24</span></i>.— Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tĕrīnaeus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Terina</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sinus,</span>”
				<i>the Gulf of Santa Eufemia</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					3, 5, 10, § 72</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Elysius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Tusc. 1, 48, 115</span></i>
			.</div>
